## Runtime (one line when mismatch; do not quiz)

- Substantial work: runtime stanza `Mode · Seat · Multitask · Plan?` · 5W1H when warranted — multitask **off** unless synthesis-owned
- Seats: Engineer · Reviewer · Finisher (+ Archivist · Attacker on-call) — `Seat:` + playbooks · active ≤3 · **Auto ≠ seats** (pin model) — `RUNTIME.md`
- Wrong-seat → one-line redirect · DoD met → stop · decide-low / ask-high · hygiene callouts (Plan on blast · land handoff · handle+query · new chat when fat) — `RUNTIME.md` · `CURSOR_CHAT_HYGIENE.md`
- Agentic: autonomy by blast · gen↔verify · design before long cook · **context as variable** (<~30k paste; warehouses = handle + query) — `AGENTIC_INTERACTION.md`
- Multi-device: notes/pack/overlay batch → commit+push; product code still ask
- Dense idea organisms: A→F before tree edits (`ORGANISM_PLACEMENT.md`)
- **Scope fence** in `.cursor/rules/*` → defer per that rule

